<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ui version="4.0">
 <class>TextureMappingDialog</class>
 <widget class="QDialog" name="TextureMappingDialog">
  <property name="geometry"><rect><x>0</x><y>0</y><width>520</width><height>540</height></rect></property>
  <property name="minimumSize"><size><width>520</width><height>0</height></size></property>
  <property name="windowTitle"><string>生成纹理</string></property>
  <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="mainLayout">
   <property name="leftMargin"><number>18</number></property>
   <property name="topMargin"><number>18</number></property>
   <property name="rightMargin"><number>18</number></property>
   <property name="bottomMargin"><number>18</number></property>
   <property name="spacing"><number>12</number></property>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="textureGroup">
     <property name="title"><string>一般</string></property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="textureForm">
      <property name="horizontalSpacing"><number>18</number></property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing"><number>9</number></property>
      <item row="0" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="fixedWorkflowLabel"><property name="text"><string>从具备有效相机与深度数据的影像生成纹理。自动选择清晰视角、展开 UV，并用 Natural 多频段融合平滑接缝；不改变模型几何。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
      <item row="1" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="texSizeLabel"><property name="text"><string>纹理大小:</string></property></widget></item>
       <item row="1" column="1"><widget class="QComboBox" name="m_texSizeCombo"><property name="toolTip"><string>单张纹理图的边长，当前支持 1024–8192。源影像与图集的估算工作内存超过 3 GiB 时会提示调整参数。</string></property><property name="currentIndex"><number>3</number></property><item><property name="text"><string>1024</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>2048</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>4096</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>8192</string></property></item></widget></item>
      <item row="2" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="imageDownscaleLabel"><property name="text"><string>影像下采样:</string></property></widget></item>
       <item row="2" column="1"><widget class="QComboBox" name="m_imageDownscaleCombo"><property name="currentIndex"><number>1</number></property><property name="toolTip"><string>x2 是 Natural 流程的推荐值；原始分辨率保留更多细节但占用更多内存。</string></property><item><property name="text"><string>原始分辨率</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>x2（推荐）</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>x4（最低内存）</string></property></item></widget></item>
      <item row="3" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="antiAliasingLabel"><property name="text"><string>抗锯齿:</string></property></widget></item>
      <item row="3" column="1"><widget class="QComboBox" name="m_antiAliasingCombo"><property name="toolTip"><string>每像素采用 1、2×2 或 4×4 个样本；更高倍率改善边缘，烘焙采样量约增至 4 或 16 倍。</string></property><item><property name="text"><string>1x（推荐）</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>2x</string></property></item><item><property name="text"><string>4x</string></property></item></widget></item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QGroupBox" name="qualityGroup">
     <property name="title"><string>高级</string></property>
     <layout class="QFormLayout" name="qualityForm">
      <property name="horizontalSpacing"><number>18</number></property>
      <property name="verticalSpacing"><number>8</number></property>
       <item row="0" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_holeFillCheck"><property name="toolTip"><string>对严格匹配失败的面放宽深度容差，再尝试邻视角恢复。UV 岛的两像素边缘扩展始终启用。</string></property><property name="text"><string>邻视角空洞恢复</string></property><property name="checked"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
       <item row="1" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_ghostFilterCheck"><property name="toolTip"><string>融合多个视角时剔除偏离中值颜色的样本，减少移动物体与错配造成的重影。</string></property><property name="text"><string>启用重影过滤器</string></property><property name="checked"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
       <item row="2" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_outOfFocusFilterCheck"><property name="toolTip"><string>根据模型各区域在不同影像中的局部清晰度，降低失焦视角的选择优先级。</string></property><property name="text"><string>局部失焦抑制</string></property></widget></item>
       <item row="3" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QCheckBox" name="m_colorCorrCheck"><property name="toolTip"><string>只用共同可见的三维区域估计影像间曝光差异。</string></property><property name="text"><string>重叠区域曝光校正</string></property><property name="checked"><bool>false</bool></property></widget></item>
      <item row="4" column="0" colspan="2"><widget class="QLabel" name="unsupportedOptionsNote"><property name="text"><string>当前不支持指定部分影像或转移已有纹理。</string></property><property name="wordWrap"><bool>true</bool></property></widget></item>
      <item row="5" column="0"><widget class="QLabel" name="seamsMarginLabel"><property name="text"><string>锐化强度:</string></property></widget></item>
       <item row="5" column="1"><widget class="QDoubleSpinBox" name="m_seamsMarginSpin"><property name="toolTip"><string>多频段融合后的反遮罩锐化强度；1.0 为参考流程默认值。</string></property><property name="decimals"><number>2</number></property><property name="minimum"><double>0.000000000000000</double></property><property name="maximum"><double>2.000000000000000</double></property><property name="singleStep"><double>0.050000000000000</double></property><property name="value"><double>1.000000000000000</double></property></widget></item>
     </layout>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item><spacer name="verticalSpacer"><property name="orientation"><enum>Qt::Vertical</enum></property><property name="sizeHint" stdset="0"><size><width>20</width><height>12</height></size></property></spacer></item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QDialogButtonBox" name="m_buttonBox">
     <property name="standardButtons">
      <set>QDialogButtonBox::Cancel|QDialogButtonBox::Ok</set>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
  </layout>
 </widget>
